# Quickmerge Watch Mode
RULE: Watch mode default. If act fails, LLM auto-fixes (max 3 attempts). Use --no-watch only when user requests.
WHY: Reduces manual fix cycles; catches CI failures before push.
CODEX: .cursor/rules/always-use-quickmerge.mdc, scripts/quickmerge.sh
DO: bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "message" (watch enabled); let LLM fix act failures
NEVER: Use --no-watch unless user asks; skip act simulation
